---
// src/components/WorkstreamsReporting.astro
---

<section id="workstreams" class="py-24 relative bg-[#070a17]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-24">
    
    <!-- Section 25: DD Workstreams -->
    <div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 font-mono">Diligence Breadth</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight mt-3">
          One platform. Every angle of the business.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          LIFT standardises requests, parameters, and evidence across all 10 core diligence disciplines—preventing blind spots between technical, financial, and legal reviews.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 10 Workstream Cards Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 mb-2">01 // FINANCE</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Financial Due Diligence</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Revenue quality, profitability, normalised EBITDA, cash burn, working capital cycle, and internal controls.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">P&L • Audit • Cash Flows</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-blue-400 mb-2">02 // TAX</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Tax Due Diligence</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Direct & indirect tax compliance, GST reconciliations, TDS filings, pending assessment orders, and exposures.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">GST • Income Tax • Notices</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 mb-2">03 // CORPORATE</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Corporate Due Diligence</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              ROC compliance, share capital history, director eligibility, secretarial registers, and statutory corporate records.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">MCA • PAS-3 • Minutes</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 mb-2">04 // LEGAL</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Legal Due Diligence</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Material customer & supplier contracts, active disputes, arbitration, court records, and non-compete covenants.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Contracts • Disputes • Covenants</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">05 // IP</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">IP Due Diligence</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Patents, registered trademarks, copyrights, founder assignment deeds, and third-party technology licensing terms.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Patents • Trademarks • Ownership</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 mb-2">06 // COMMERCIAL</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Commercial DD</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Addressable market size, customer retention, churn, pricing power, competitive moats, and unit economics.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Market • Retention • Moats</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-rose-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-rose-400 mb-2">07 // TECH</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Technology DD</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Architecture resilience, code quality, open-source license risks, infrastructure scaling, and cybersecurity posture.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Architecture • Cloud • Cyber</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 mb-2">08 // HR</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">HR Due Diligence</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Key personnel contracts, employment benefits, provident fund/gratuity compliances, and ESOP pool vesting status.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">ESOP • PF / Gratuity • Key Men</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 mb-2">09 // VALUATION</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Valuation</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              DCF analysis, comparable transaction multiples, intangible asset valuation, and transaction pricing rationale.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">DCF • Multiples • Assets</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">10 // DOMAIN</div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-heading">Domain / Sector DD</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Industry-specific operating dynamics (Fintech, Healthtech, Cleantech, Agritech, Deeptech, Manufacturing) & sector regulations.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Sector Rules • Licensing</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 26: Final DD Report & Evidence Traceability -->
    <div id="reporting" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">
          Decision Intelligence Deliverable
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight">
          From thousands of documents to one decision-ready report.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          LIFT brings together findings from every workstream into a structured final report ready for Investment Committees, Board approvals, and transaction closings.
        </p>

        <!-- Signature Positioning: Evidence Traceability -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-heading">
            Traceable Diligence From Source to Conclusion
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Every critical observation links back along an unbroken digital chain:
          </p>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 text-[11px] font-mono text-indigo-300 flex items-center justify-between overflow-x-auto">
            <span>Finding</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
            <span>DD Parameter</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
            <span>Query</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
            <span>Document</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
            <span>Expert</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="/contact?intent=start-dd" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-all shadow-md">
            <span>Initiate Diligence Report</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Report Structure Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 glass-panel-glow rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-white/10 text-xs">
          <span class="font-semibold text-white">Investment Committee Final DD Dossier</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400">Decision-Ready Format</span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">01</span>
            <span>Executive Summary</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">02</span>
            <span>Transaction Scope</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">03</span>
            <span>Key Findings & Red Flags</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">04</span>
            <span>Financial Integrity</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">05</span>
            <span>Tax Review & Exposures</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">06</span>
            <span>Corporate & MCA Review</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">07</span>
            <span>Contracts & Litigation</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">08</span>
            <span>IP Ownership Review</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">09</span>
            <span>Conditions Precedent (CP)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400">10</span>
            <span>Final IC Recommendation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
